invalid type: string "admin database to create \nan administrative user. \nmongosh admin \nNote: Global roles like userAdminAnyDatabase, readWriteAnyDatabase, \nand dbAdminAnyDatabase are defined only in the admin database. \n \ndb.createUser({ \n  user: \"superadmin\", \n  pwd: \"securepass\", \n  roles: [ { role: \"userAdminAnyDatabase\", db: \"admin\" }, \"readWriteAnyDatabase\" ] \n}) \nn \nÿÿ